# 统一行尾，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 协作时整文件 diff。
# 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把 LF 的源文件在 checkout 时转成 CRLF，
# 再提交回去就变成全文改动的假 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理与 PowerShell 脚本必须 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源，禁止行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary

# lockfile 不做行尾转换，保持 pnpm 生成的原样
pnpm-lock.yaml -text
